 $schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
 
-title: Maxim Integrated DS4422/DS4424 7-bit Sink/Source Current DAC
+title: Maxim Integrated DS4402/DS4404 and DS4422/DS4424 Current DACs
 
